                "description": "The floral design of this oval knob is just one of many beautiful embellishments that makes the Omnia 59  Floral Oval Knob with Beaded Rose fantastic. Intricately detailed, this solid brass latchset features beading along both the rose and the knob. Every inch of this ornate knob is dripping with an elegance that will surely add glamor to your home. The Floral Oval Knobset is available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes in privacy, passage, or dummy functions.\r\n",
